# Edugenie: Google Gemini-Powered Learning Assistant

## Project Development Phase

---

### 1. Overview & Objectives

The **Project Development Phase** covers the actual implementation, coding, and integration of core features for **Edugenie**. This phase focuses on setting up the repository environment, developing backend service routes, integrating the Google Gemini API, and connecting the user interface.

---

### 2. Environment Setup & Project Structure

#### Tech Stack Configured

* **Frontend:** React / Next.js with Tailwind CSS
* **Backend:** Node.js (Express) / Python (FastAPI)
* **SDK:** `@google/genai` (Google Gemini SDK)

#### Recommended Folder Structure

```text
Edugenie/
├── backend/
│   ├── config/          # Gemini API Key & Env setup
│   ├── controllers/     # Route handler logic (Summarizer, Quiz, Chat)
